message: "If you use this repository, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Hypsographic Demography: Data and Reproducible Analysis Code"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Zimmer
    given-names: Andrew
    affiliation: Oak Ridge National Laboratory
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-7683-8713"
abstract: >-
  Derived data and reproducible analysis code supporting the manuscript
  ‘Hypsographic Demography: Global Population Structure and Change Across
  Elevation Gradients.’ The archive contains processed data underlying the
  manuscript figures and principal results, within-country comparisons,
  sensitivity analyses, Jupyter notebooks, Python processing and plotting
  scripts, and final manuscript figures. Large source population, elevation,
  and settlement rasters are not redistributed and are referenced to their
  original public sources.
keywords:
  - hypsographic demography
  - population
  - elevation
  - age structure
  - settlement
  - human geography
  - global change
  - reproducible research
repository-code: "https://github.com/zimmermaps/hypsographic_demography"
